From 3cc29d1fae8481cbc00d32cf94afb1e2527d46f1 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: aeronexus <aeronexus@local>
Date: Fri, 2 Oct 2026 16:27:50 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] onprem: show flight routes on the map, edit area routes as
 copy

Flight Route Library: clicking a route shows its area and the flight path
computed by Pilot 2 on the Leaflet map (data from the mapping service).
mapping2d routes can be edited as a copy: drag/add/delete polygon corners,
height, direction, margin, overlap, speed; saved as a new library route.
Other template types are shown read-only.
